  "content": "\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><em><strong><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1482828019608326256/1526611169278824599/image.png?ex=6a57a6f1&is=6a565571&hm=4934f3f4d2ccffb7314815f3b4ba53ce8911f6cf9ef233cb7998feb78aef1bb2&\" alt=\"\" width=\"657\" height=\"132\"></strong></em></span></h1>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Agmundr 希望你在生存技能上加以運用，並透過任務系統教你遊戲中的所有內容。<br><br></strong><em>追蹤開發進度與更新，請關注我們的 <span style=\"color:#3598db\">Discord 伺服器！</span></em><br><span style=\"color:#843fa1\"><br></span></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/8dTaxX3mdB\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1381526/description_06e3a0f9-6ce5-43fe-8e02-95284723b060.gif\" width=\"208\" height=\"71\"></a></span></strong></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1482828019608326256/1526613215193202708/features.png?ex=6a57a8d9&is=6a565759&hm=158f290b9bc6d341b0a8353afd0000142eebced31f192a70e4f860b2a7b26475&\" alt=\"\" width=\"544\" height=\"75\"></strong></em></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>&nbsp;</strong></em></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><br>- 遊戲內截圖</strong><strong><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1482828019608326256/1526647234534314145/2026-07-14_20.50.45.png?ex=6a57c888&is=6a567708&hm=073091ab77114950fd7f6e719777d5854b7f40121bf782ff9ae5226ed91ec991&\" alt=\"\"><br><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1482828019608326256/1526647232777027776/2026-07-14_20.48.08.png?ex=6a57c888&is=6a567708&hm=1e334452cec1808f68c32cb63a39c42284e36d0e86b1ca929431052ab59eb97d&=&format=webp&quality=lossless&width=1521&height=856\" alt=\"\" width=\"1521\" height=\"856\"><br><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1482828019608326256/1526647233393463316/2026-07-14_20.49.05.png?ex=6a57c888&is=6a567708&hm=63f50150abaec683eba2effde3288d4228cf05525e4306e536c68a16e829b471&=&format=webp&quality=lossless&width=1521&height=856\" alt=\"\" width=\"1521\" height=\"856\"><br><br>- 獨特難度系統<br><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1526583139630317809/1526641528196436058/javaw_vmuGxtw5vN.gif?ex=6a57c337&is=6a5671b7&hm=7e3e6d722ced0f0ca010cb98d2f2e7c9a73960725ade5acbada7be4666938b11&\" alt=\"\" width=\"687\" height=\"336\"><br><br>- 獨特職業系統<br><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1526583139630317809/1526641858590015528/javaw_Yb4fsE29R7.gif?ex=6a57c386&is=6a567206&hm=9da85c3efbb1cfeae9d0a1b95d8f3b308291665eaf9944707f9ea7233569305e&\" alt=\"\" width=\"687\" height=\"318\"><br></strong></h1>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><em>-<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">獨特</span> 特殊殭屍</em></strong><br><strong><em>-<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">科技系統</span>（Create 模组）<span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\">搭配</span> <span style=\"color:#ba372a\">任務線</span>，協助你對抗殭屍</em></strong><br><strong><em>-<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">真實</span> 部位傷害</em></strong><br><strong><em>-<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">四季更替與世界生成</span></em></strong><br><em><strong>-<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">裝飾性</span> 模组</strong></em><br><strong><em>-射擊時會引起殭屍<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">注意</span></em></strong><br><strong><em>-<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">超過 50 種武器與枪械</span>，各附獨立強度排行榜<br>-<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">超過 20 套</span> 盔甲</em></strong><br><strong><em>-為<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">Mosslorn</span> 地圖設計的<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">獨特掉落物</span></em></strong><br><strong><em>-更多！</em></strong></h3>\n</div>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><br><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1482828019608326256/1526613214526177290/installation.png?ex=6a57a8d9&is=6a565759&hm=4cfaa2797d394482288429d3c6bc830937e2c133c68e9f12e12d25ea54a3c7bc&=&format=webp&quality=lossless&width=1204&height=116\" alt=\"\" width=\"575\" height=\"55\"><br><br></strong></h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\">最低記憶體配置：<br></span><strong>單人模式：5GB</strong><br><strong>伺服器：8GB</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">建議記憶體配置：<br></span><strong>單人模式：7GB</strong><br><strong>伺服器：12GB+</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">理想記憶體配置：<br></span><strong>單人模式：9GB</strong><br><strong>伺服器：12GB+</strong></p>\n</div>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><br><img src=\"https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1482828019608326256/1526613214203347116/specialthanksnango.png?ex=6a57a8d9&is=6a565759&hm=80a113890bdd7e4c6c57328ca54476d8af73eca5ed7171db9aa46522a63fb34c&=&format=webp&quality=lossless&width=1204&height=102\" alt=\"\" width=\"521\" height=\"44\"><br></strong></h4>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\">特別感謝：&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/misanthropy/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">misanthropy</a></strong> &nbsp;（主要貢獻者）<br>地圖製作：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/mosslorn-1000x1000-abandoned-overgrown-city\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <strong>milkshake_mp3</strong></a></h4>\n</div>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">選擇此模组包，即可透過 <span style=\"color:#843fa1\">Kinetic Hosting</span> 與朋友們享受歡樂的遊玩體驗。</h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong><br><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.kinetichosting.com%252fmodpacks%252fagmundr-zombie-apocalypse%252forder\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1381526/description_f4087686-908b-49c7-88f1-089b3bf89623.png\"></a><br></strong></em></h3>",
